{
  "about": "The cases every fake Hub passes: the Node server of server.ts (conformance.test.ts) and the in-memory Hub of the pipette-hub crate. A case without control steps and without \"localHub\": false also runs against a local pipette-hub in its test mode (local-hub.test.ts, skipped unless PIPETTE_HUB_LOCAL_URL is set). Each case starts on an empty Hub.",
  "format": [
    "A step is a control step ({\"control\": …}) or a request step ({\"request\": \"METHOD /path?query\", …}).",
    "Substitution: in every string of a step, {name} is the value a step saved as name and {run} is the run tag (empty on a fake; on a local Hub a fresh tag per run and case, so cases do not see each other's records). A name nothing saved is an error in the case. Saved ids are put in paths as they are.",
    "Control steps: user {email, displayName: string|null, active?: boolean} creates the account or changes it; fault {status, count, retryAfter?: string, body?: string, only?: route} (a fake refuses an invalid fault: status not an integer HTTP status, count not a positive integer, only not a route name) makes the next count requests to API routes (of that route only, when given) answer status with that Retry-After and body (the default body is {\"ok\":false,\"error\":<the text for the status: 401 'Invalid or expired token', 403 'Account is deactivated', 404 'Not found', 409 'Conflict', 429 'Too many requests', 500 'Internal server error'>}); keyLabel {owner: email|'system', name, map, save?} creates a key label and saves its id; touch {kind: post|privatePost|i18n|theme|keyLabel, id} moves its updated_at on; revokeTokens forgets every Hub JWT issued.",
    "Routes for only: auth.token auth.me auth.patchMe files.me files.meKeyboard files.get files.create files.update files.patch files.delete private.create private.delete, and {i18n,theme,keyLabels}.{list,get,download,timestamps,create,update,delete}.",
    "Request steps: auth names a saved Hub JWT sent as `Authorization: Bearer <jwt>`; auth starting with ! sends the rest as the bearer as it is. Body: json (sent as JSON.stringify with Content-Type application/json; an object {\"$range\": {\"prefix\": p, \"count\": n}} anywhere in it stands for the strings p1 … pn), raw (the text as it is, Content-Type application/json), or multipart (a list of parts sent as the desktop app's MultipartBuilder does: boundary ----PipetteBoundary1767225600000, a field {name, value}, a file {name, filename, contentType, content | contentBase64 | contentJson} where contentJson is sent as compact JSON with its keys in the order written; a string \"$<template>\" in the list stands for the parts of that template). No fake checks the boundary's name; any boundary the Content-Type names works.",
    "Names compare as the Hub's SQLite lower() does: ASCII letters only (Rust: to_ascii_lowercase), for display-name conflicts, pack and key-label name conflicts, the name filter and the q search; Ü and ü stay different.",
    "expect: status (required); headers {name: value, null for absent}; json, a pattern the parsed body must match; pretty: true, the body text is its JSON pretty-printed with two spaces. save {name: path} saves values of the body at dotted paths (a number is an array index).",
    "Patterns: an object matches an object having every key of the pattern with a matching value (other keys allowed); \"$keys\": [...] in an object pattern requires exactly those keys in that order; {\"$length\": n} matches an array of n elements; an array matches an array of the same length element by element; a string \"$any\" matches anything present, \"$absent\" (as a value) requires the key to be missing, \"$string\", \"$number\", \"$uuid\" (8-4-4-4-12 hex), \"$jwt\" (three base64url segments), \"$privateToken\" (pt_v1_ and 43 base64url characters), \"$hubStamp\" (2026-01-01 00:00:01.000Z), \"$postCreatedStamp\" (2026-01-01 00:00:01), \"$isoTimestamp\" (2026-01-01T00:00:01.000Z), \"$saved:<name>\" the saved value, \"$after:<name>\" a string greater than the saved one; any other value must be equal."
  ],
  "templates": {
    "keyboardFiles": [
      { "name": "vil", "filename": "kb.vil", "contentType": "application/json", "content": "{\"layout\":[]}" },
      { "name": "pipette", "filename": "kb.pipette", "contentType": "application/json", "content": "{\"version\":1}" },
      { "name": "c", "filename": "kb.c", "contentType": "text/plain", "content": "// keymap" },
      { "name": "pdf", "filename": "kb.pdf", "contentType": "application/pdf", "content": "%PDF-1.4" },
      { "name": "thumbnail", "filename": "kb.jpg", "contentType": "image/jpeg", "contentBase64": "/9j/4AAQSkZJRg==" }
    ],
    "analyticsFiles": [
      { "name": "json", "filename": "analytics-export-v1.json", "contentType": "application/json", "contentJson": {
        "version": 1, "kind": "analytics", "exportedAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "snapshot": { "keyboard": { "uid": "0xAB", "productName": "Board{run}" }, "range": { "fromMs": 0, "toMs": 60000 }, "totalKeystrokes": 150, "keymapSnapshot": {}, "appScopes": [] },
        "filters": {},
        "data": { "minuteStats": [], "matrixCells": [], "matrixCellsByDay": [], "layerUsage": [], "sessions": [], "bksMinute": [], "bigramTop": [], "bigramSlow": [], "appUsage": [], "wpmByApp": [], "peakRecords": {}, "layoutComparison": null }
      } },
      { "name": "thumbnail", "filename": "analytics.jpg", "contentType": "image/jpeg", "contentBase64": "/9j/4AAQSkZJRg==" }
    ],
    "themeFile": [
      { "name": "json", "filename": "theme-pack.json", "contentType": "application/json", "contentJson": {
        "name": "Theme{run}", "version": "1.0.0", "colorScheme": "dark",
        "colors": {
          "surface": "#101010", "surface-alt": "#111111", "surface-dim": "#121212", "surface-raised": "#131313",
          "content": "#f0f0f0", "content-secondary": "#e0e0e0", "content-muted": "#d0d0d0", "content-inverse": "#000000",
          "edge": "#202020", "edge-subtle": "#212121", "edge-strong": "#222222",
          "accent": "#3366ff", "accent-hover": "#4477ff", "accent-alt": "#5588ff", "success": "#22aa22", "warning": "#aaaa22", "danger": "#aa2222", "pending": "#888888",
          "key-bg": "#303030", "key-bg-hover": "#313131", "key-bg-active": "#323232", "key-border": "#333333", "key-shadow": "#343434",
          "key-label": "#fafafa", "key-sublabel": "#f5f5f5", "key-label-remap": "#ffcc00", "key-bg-multi-selected": "#404080",
          "tab-bg-active": "#505050", "tab-text": "#c0c0c0", "tab-text-active": "#ffffff",
          "picker-bg": "#1a1a1a", "picker-item-bg": "#2a2a2a", "picker-item-hover": "#3a3a3a", "picker-item-text": "#eeeeee", "picker-item-border": "rgb(10, 10, 10)"
        }
      } }
    ]
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "token and account",
      "steps": [
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": {}, "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Missing id_token" } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "raw": "{not json", "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Invalid JSON" } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:no-at-sign" }, "expect": { "status": 401, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Invalid or expired token" } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:alice{run}@example.com" },
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "$keys": ["ok", "data"], "ok": true, "data": { "$keys": ["token", "user"], "token": "$jwt",
            "user": { "$keys": ["id", "email", "display_name", "role"], "id": "$uuid", "email": "alice{run}@example.com", "display_name": "alice{run}", "role": "user" } } } },
          "save": { "alice": "data.token", "aliceId": "data.user.id" } },
        { "request": "GET /api/auth/me", "auth": "alice",
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "$keys": ["id", "email", "display_name", "role"], "id": "$saved:aliceId", "display_name": "alice{run}" } } } },
        { "request": "GET /api/auth/me", "expect": { "status": 401, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Authentication required" } } },
        { "request": "GET /api/auth/me", "auth": "!not-a-hub-jwt", "expect": { "status": 401, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Invalid or expired token" } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:bob{run}@example.com", "display_name": "Alice{run}" },
          "expect": { "status": 409, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "display_name is already taken" } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:bob{run}@example.com", "display_name": "   " },
          "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "display_name must not be empty" } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:bob{run}@example.com", "display_name": "  Bob{run}  " },
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "user": { "display_name": "Bob{run}" } } } }, "save": { "bob": "data.token" } },
        { "request": "PATCH /api/auth/me", "auth": "bob", "json": { "display_name": "admin" }, "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "display_name is reserved" } } },
        { "request": "PATCH /api/auth/me", "auth": "bob", "json": { "display_name": "ALICE{run}" }, "expect": { "status": 409, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "display_name is already taken" } } },
        { "request": "PATCH /api/auth/me", "auth": "bob", "json": {}, "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "No fields to update" } } },
        { "request": "PATCH /api/auth/me", "auth": "bob", "json": { "display_name": "x", "role": "admin" }, "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Unknown field in request body" } } },
        { "request": "PATCH /api/auth/me", "auth": "bob", "json": { "display_name": "Robert{run}" },
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "display_name": "Robert{run}", "email": "bob{run}@example.com" } } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:alice{run}@example.com", "display_name": "Other{run}" },
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "token": "$jwt", "user": { "id": "$saved:aliceId", "display_name": "alice{run}" } } } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "accounts without a display name, JWT id_tokens, deactivated accounts",
      "localHub": false,
      "steps": [
        { "control": "user", "email": "carol@example.com", "displayName": null },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:carol@example.com" },
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "user": { "email": "carol@example.com", "display_name": null } } } }, "save": { "carol": "data.token" } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "carol", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "T" }, { "name": "keyboard_name", "value": "KB" }, "$keyboardFiles"],
          "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Display name is required to upload" } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/key-labels", "auth": "carol", "json": { "name": "L", "map": {} },
          "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Display name is required to upload" } } },
        { "request": "PATCH /api/auth/me", "auth": "carol", "json": { "display_name": "Carol" }, "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "display_name": "Carol" } } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "carol", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "T" }, { "name": "keyboard_name", "value": "KB" }, "$keyboardFiles"],
          "expect": { "status": 201, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "title": "T", "uploader_name": "Carol" } } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "eyJhbGciOiJub25lIiwidHlwIjoiSldUIn0.eyJpc3MiOiJmYWtlLWRyaXZlIiwiYXVkIjoiY2xpZW50Iiwic3ViIjoiZmFrZS1zdWItMSIsImVtYWlsIjoiZGF2ZUBleGFtcGxlLmludmFsaWQiLCJpYXQiOjE3NjcyMjU2MDAsImV4cCI6MTc2NzIyOTIwMH0.fake" },
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "token": "$jwt", "user": { "email": "dave@example.invalid", "display_name": null } } } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "eyJhbGciOiJub25lIiwidHlwIjoiSldUIn0.eyJpc3MiOiJmYWtlLWRyaXZlIiwiYXVkIjoiY2xpZW50Iiwic3ViIjoiZmFrZS1zdWItMiIsImVtYWlsIjoiZXJpbkBleGFtcGxlLmludmFsaWQiLCJpYXQiOjE3NjcyMjU2MDAsImV4cCI6MTc2NzIyOTIwMH0.fake", "display_name": "Erin" },
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "user": { "email": "erin@example.invalid", "display_name": "Erin" } } } } },
        { "control": "user", "email": "frank@example.com", "displayName": "Frank", "active": false },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:frank@example.com" }, "expect": { "status": 403, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Account is deactivated" } } },
        { "control": "user", "email": "carol@example.com", "displayName": "Carol", "active": false },
        { "request": "GET /api/auth/me", "auth": "carol", "expect": { "status": 403, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Account is deactivated" } } },
        { "control": "user", "email": "carol@example.com", "displayName": "Carol", "active": true },
        { "request": "GET /api/auth/me", "auth": "carol", "expect": { "status": 200 } },
        { "control": "revokeTokens" },
        { "request": "GET /api/auth/me", "auth": "carol", "expect": { "status": 401, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Invalid or expired token" } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "my posts: pages and the keyboard filter",
      "steps": [
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:alice{run}@example.com" }, "expect": { "status": 200 }, "save": { "alice": "data.token", "aliceId": "data.user.id" } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "P1" }, { "name": "keyboard_name", "value": "KB{run}" }, "$keyboardFiles"],
          "expect": { "status": 201, "json": { "ok": true, "data": {
            "$keys": ["id", "title", "keyboard_name", "uploaded_by", "download_count", "created_at", "updated_at", "post_type", "keyboard_uid", "total_keystrokes", "range_from_ms", "range_to_ms", "uploader_name", "files"],
            "id": "$uuid", "title": "P1", "keyboard_name": "KB{run}", "uploaded_by": "$saved:aliceId", "download_count": 0, "created_at": "$postCreatedStamp", "updated_at": "$hubStamp",
            "post_type": "keyboard", "keyboard_uid": null, "total_keystrokes": null, "range_from_ms": null, "range_to_ms": null, "uploader_name": "alice{run}",
            "files": [
              { "$keys": ["file_type", "original_filename", "file_size"], "file_type": "c", "original_filename": "kb.c", "file_size": 9 },
              { "file_type": "pdf", "original_filename": "kb.pdf", "file_size": 8 },
              { "file_type": "pipette", "original_filename": "kb.pipette", "file_size": 13 },
              { "file_type": "vil", "original_filename": "kb.vil", "file_size": 13 }
            ] } } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "P2" }, { "name": "keyboard_name", "value": "KB{run}" }, "$keyboardFiles"], "expect": { "status": 201 } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "P3" }, { "name": "keyboard_name", "value": "Other{run}" }, "$keyboardFiles"], "expect": { "status": 201 } },
        { "request": "GET /api/files/me?page=1&per_page=2", "auth": "alice",
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "$keys": ["items", "total", "page", "per_page"], "items": [{ "title": "P3" }, { "title": "P2" }], "total": 3, "page": 1, "per_page": 2 } } } },
        { "request": "GET /api/files/me?page=2&per_page=2", "auth": "alice",
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "items": [{ "title": "P1" }], "total": 3, "page": 2, "per_page": 2 } } } },
        { "request": "GET /api/files/me", "auth": "alice", "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "items": { "$length": 3 }, "page": 1, "per_page": 20 } } } },
        { "request": "GET /api/files/me?page=0&per_page=500", "auth": "alice", "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "items": { "$length": 3 }, "page": 1, "per_page": 100 } } } },
        { "request": "GET /api/files/me/keyboard?name=KB{run}", "auth": "alice", "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": [{ "title": "P2" }, { "title": "P1" }] } } },
        { "request": "GET /api/files/me/keyboard?name=%20%20", "auth": "alice", "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Query parameter \"name\" is required" } } },
        { "request": "GET /api/files/me", "expect": { "status": 401, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Authentication required" } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "multipart create, PUT and PATCH",
      "steps": [
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:alice{run}@example.com" }, "expect": { "status": 200 }, "save": { "alice": "data.token" } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:bob{run}@example.com" }, "expect": { "status": 200 }, "save": { "bob": "data.token" } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "P1" }, { "name": "keyboard_name", "value": "KB{run}" }, "$keyboardFiles"],
          "expect": { "status": 201 }, "save": { "p1": "data.id", "p1Updated": "data.updated_at" } },
        { "request": "PUT /api/files/{p1}", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "P1 v2" }, { "name": "keyboard_name", "value": "KB{run}" }, "$keyboardFiles"],
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "id": "$saved:p1", "title": "P1 v2", "updated_at": "$after:p1Updated" } } }, "save": { "p1Updated": "data.updated_at" } },
        { "request": "PATCH /api/files/{p1}", "auth": "alice", "json": { "title": "  P1 v3  " },
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "id": "$saved:p1", "title": "P1 v3", "updated_at": "$after:p1Updated" } } } },
        { "request": "PATCH /api/files/{p1}", "auth": "alice", "json": {}, "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "No fields to update" } } },
        { "request": "PATCH /api/files/{p1}", "auth": "alice", "json": { "title": "" }, "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Title must be a non-empty string" } } },
        { "request": "PUT /api/files/{p1}", "auth": "bob", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "Mine" }, "$keyboardFiles"], "expect": { "status": 403, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Forbidden" } } },
        { "request": "PATCH /api/files/{p1}", "auth": "bob", "json": { "title": "Mine" }, "expect": { "status": 403, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Forbidden" } } },
        { "request": "PUT /api/files/00000000-0000-4000-8000-ffffffffffff", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "X" }, "$keyboardFiles"],
          "expect": { "status": 404, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Post not found" } } },
        { "request": "GET /api/files/{p1}", "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "id": "$saved:p1", "title": "P1 v3" } } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "keyboard_name", "value": "KB" }, "$keyboardFiles"], "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "Title is required" } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "T" },
            { "name": "thumbnail", "filename": "kb.jpg", "contentType": "image/jpeg", "contentBase64": "/9j/" }],
          "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "File \"vil\" is required" } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "Macro" }, { "name": "post_type", "value": "macro" },
            { "name": "json", "filename": "macro.json", "contentType": "application/json", "contentJson": { "version": 3, "vial_protocol": 6, "type": "macro", "data": [] } }],
          "expect": { "status": 201, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "title": "Macro", "post_type": "macro", "keyboard_name": null, "files": [{ "file_type": "json", "original_filename": "macro.json" }] } } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "Macro" }, { "name": "post_type", "value": "macro" },
            { "name": "json", "filename": "macro.json", "contentType": "application/json", "contentJson": { "version": 3, "type": "macro", "data": [] } }],
          "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "vial_protocol is required for FavoriteExportFile v3" } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "Stats" }, { "name": "post_type", "value": "analytics" }, "$analyticsFiles"],
          "expect": { "status": 201, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "title": "Stats", "post_type": "analytics", "keyboard_name": "Board{run}", "keyboard_uid": "0xAB",
            "total_keystrokes": 150, "range_from_ms": 0, "range_to_ms": 60000, "files": [{ "file_type": "json", "original_filename": "analytics-export-v1.json" }] } } },
          "save": { "stats": "data.id" } },
        { "request": "PUT /api/files/{stats}", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "Stats v2" }, "$analyticsFiles"],
          "expect": { "status": 200, "json": { "ok": true, "data": { "id": "$saved:stats", "title": "Stats v2", "post_type": "analytics" } } } },
        { "request": "POST /api/files", "auth": "alice", "multipart": [{ "name": "title", "value": "Stats" }, { "name": "post_type", "value": "analytics" },
            { "name": "json", "filename": "analytics-export-v1.json", "contentType": "application/json", "contentJson": { "version": 2 } },
            { "name": "thumbnail", "filename": "analytics.jpg", "contentType": "image/jpeg", "contentBase64": "/9j/" }],
          "expect": { "status": 400, "json": { "ok": false, "error": "INVALID_PAYLOAD: unsupported version" } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "DELETE, 404 and private posts",
      "steps": [
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:alice{run}@example.com" }, "expect": { "status": 200 }, "save": { "alice": "data.token" } },
        { "request": "POST /api/auth/token", "json": { "id_token": "test:bob{run}@example.com" }, "expect": { "status": 200 }, "save": { "bob": "data.token" } },
